WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Ground support is confirmed before takeoff.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:18.800
The coupled powertrain supplies propulsion power during takeoff.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:28.400
The UAV accelerates forward while gaining altitude.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.067
Cruise motion is coupled to fuel-cell and battery power sharing.

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:56.333
A lateral detour clears a known static obstacle.

00:00:56.333 --> 00:01:10.000
Forward speed decreases before the landing approach.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:44.133
Descent slows near the ground for a controlled touchdown.

00:01:44.133 --> 00:01:51.600
Ground contact is followed by disarm and shaft-power decay.
